<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>冒泡排序逐步演示</title>
<style>
  :root{--bg:#0f1720;--fg:#e8eef5;--accent:#4fc3f7;--muted:#8aa0b4;--panel:#18232e;
        --cmp:#ffb74d;--swap:#ef5350;--done:#66bb6a;}
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--fg);font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;padding:16px;}
  h1{font-size:1.15rem;margin:0 0 4px;}
  .sub{color:var(--muted);font-size:.85rem;margin-bottom:14px;line-height:1.5;}
  .wrap{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 320px;gap:16px;align-items:start;}
  @media(max-width:820px){.wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
  .card{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid #263646;border-radius:10px;padding:12px;}
  .panel{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid #263646;border-radius:10px;padding:14px;}
  .bars{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:6px;height:240px;padding:10px 4px 0;border-bottom:2px solid #36506a;overflow-x:auto;}
  .bar{flex:1 1 0;min-width:22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-end;transition:background .12s;}
  .bar .body{width:100%;border-radius:4px 4px 0 0;background:#3a5570;transition:background .15s, height .15s;position:relative;}
  .bar .body span{position:absolute;bottom:3px;left:0;right:0;text-align:center;font-size:.7rem;color:#e8eef5;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;}
  .bar .label{font-size:.72rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:4px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;}
  .bar.cmp .body{background:var(--cmp);} 
  .bar.cmp .body span{color:#1a1200;}
  .bar.swap .body{background:var(--swap);} 
  .bar.swap .body span{color:#2a0000;}
  .bar.done .body{background:var(--done);} 
  .bar.done .body span{color:#03200a;}
  .status{margin-top:12px;font-size:.86rem;line-height:1.55;min-height:2.6em;}
  .status b{color:var(--accent);}
  .btns{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px;margin-bottom:12px;}
  button{background:#22364a;color:var(--fg);border:1px solid #33506b;border-radius:8px;padding:9px 8px;font-size:.85rem;cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit;}
  button:hover:not(:disabled){background:#2c4863;}
  button:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:not-allowed;}
  button.primary{background:var(--accent);color:#062633;border-color:var(--accent);font-weight:600;}
  button.primary:hover:not(:disabled){background:#79d4f8;}
  .full{grid-column:1 / -1;}
  .ctrl{margin-bottom:14px;}
  label{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;font-size:.88rem;margin-bottom:6px;}
  .val{color:var(--accent);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-weight:600;}
  input[type=range]{width:100%;accent-color:var(--accent);}
  input[type=text]{width:100%;background:#0b131b;border:1px solid #2c3d4e;border-radius:6px;color:var(--fg);padding:7px 8px;font-size:.85rem;font-family:inherit;}
  .readout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px;margin-top:12px;}
  .mini{background:#0b131b;border:1px solid #223141;border-radius:8px;padding:8px 10px;}
  .mini .k{font-size:.72rem;color:var(--muted);}
  .mini .v{font-size:1rem;color:var(--accent);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-weight:600;}
  .legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;font-size:.75rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px;}
  .legend i{display:inline-block;width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:2px;margin-right:4px;vertical-align:middle;}
  .assume{font-size:.75rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6;margin-top:12px;border-top:1px dashed #2c3d4e;padding-top:9px;}
  .assume b{color:#c7d6e4;}
  .msg{font-size:.78rem;color:var(--warn,#ffb74d);margin-top:6px;min-height:1em;}
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>冒泡排序：逐步演示</h1>
  <div class="sub">单步执行每一次“比较—交换”，观察大元素如何一轮轮冒到末尾。可回退、可自动播放。</div>

  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="bars" id="bars"></div>
      <div class="status" id="status">准备开始。</div>
      <div class="legend">
        <span><i style="background:#3a5570"></i>未排序</span>
        <span><i style="background:#ffb74d"></i>正在比较</span>
        <span><i style="background:#ef5350"></i>发生交换</span>
        <span><i style="background:#66bb6a"></i>已就位</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="panel">
      <div class="btns">
        <button id="btnPrev" type="button">◀ 上一步</button>
        <button id="btnNext" class="primary" type="button">下一步 ▶</button>
        <button id="btnPlay" class="full" type="button">▶ 自动播放</button>
        <button id="btnReset" class="full" type="button">↺ 重置</button>
      </div>

      <div class="ctrl">
        <label for="speed">播放速度 <span class="val" id="speedOut">1.0×</span></label>
        <input id="speed" type="range" min="0.25" max="3" step="0.25" value="1">
      </div>

      <div class="ctrl">
        <label for="data">自定义数组（用逗号或空格分隔）</label>
        <input id="data" type="text" value="5,2,9,1,6,3" aria-label="自定义数组输入">
        <div class="msg" id="msg"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="readout">
        <div class="mini"><div class="k">当前步</div><div class="v" id="stepNo">0 / 0</div></div>
        <div class="mini"><div class="k">比较次数</div><div class="v" id="cmpCount">0</div></div>
        <div class="mini"><div class="k">交换次数</div><div class="v" id="swapCount">0</div></div>
        <div class="mini"><div class="k">元素个数</div><div class="v" id="nCount">6</div></div>
      </div>

      <div class="assume">
        <b>算法假设：</b>对数组做升序冒泡排序。外层 i 从 0 到 n−2，内层 j 从 0 到 n−2−i，比较 a[j] 与 a[j+1]，若 a[j] &gt; a[j+1] 则交换；每轮结束 a[n−1−i] 就位。
        演示把每次“比较”记为一帧（交换帧附带新数组）。数组元素为整数，长度 2–12，数值范围 −99…999。若某轮无交换则提前结束。
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

<script>
(function(){
  const barsEl = document.getElementById("bars");
  const statusEl = document.getElementById("status");
  const msgEl = document.getElementById("msg");
  const stepNoEl = document.getElementById("stepNo");
  const cmpEl = document.getElementById("cmpCount");
  const swapEl = document.getElementById("swapCount");
  const nEl = document.getElementById("nCount");
  const speedEl = document.getElementById("speed");
  const speedOut = document.getElementById("speedOut");
  const dataEl = document.getElementById("data");
  const btnPrev = document.getElementById("btnPrev");
  const btnNext = document.getElementById("btnNext");
  const btnPlay = document.getElementById("btnPlay");
  const btnReset = document.getElementById("btnReset");

  let initial = [5,2,9,1,6,3];
  let frames = [];      // 每一帧：{arr, cmp:[i,j], swapped:bool, doneFrom:int, i, j, early:bool}
  let cursor = 0;       // 当前显示第几帧（-1 表示初始状态）
  let playing = false;
  let timer = null;

  function parseInput(str){
    const parts = str.split(/[\s,;]+/).filter(Boolean);
    const nums = [];
    for(const p of parts){
      const v = Number(p);
      if(!Number.isFinite(v) || !Number.isInteger(v)) return null;
      if(v < -99 || v > 999) return null;
      nums.push(v);
    }
    if(nums.length < 2 || nums.length > 12) return null;
    return nums;
  }

  function buildFrames(src){
    const arr = src.slice();
    const n = arr.length;
    const fs = [];
    let doneFrom = n;    // 索引 >= doneFrom 视为已就位
    let cmpCount = 0, swapCount = 0;
    let early = false;

    outer:
    for(let i = 0; i < n - 1; i++){
      let swappedThisRound = false;
      for(let j = 0; j < n - 1 - i; j++){
        cmpCount++;
        const willSwap = arr[j] > arr[j+1];
        if(willSwap){
          const t = arr[j]; arr[j] = arr[j+1]; arr[j+1] = t;
          swapCount++;
          swappedThisRound = true;
        }
        fs.push({
          arr: arr.slice(),
          cmp: [j, j+1],
          swapped: willSwap,
          doneFrom: n - i,          // 本轮结束时末尾 i 个已就位；但当前帧里尚未结算，用 i 表示
          round: i,
          j: j,
          cmpCount: cmpCount,
          swapCount: swapCount,
          settledUpTo: n - i        // 索引 >= n-i 已经就位（上一轮的结果）
        });
      }
      // 本轮结束，a[n-1-i] 就位
      if(!swappedThisRound){ early = true; break outer; }
    }
    // 标记最后一帧为完成
    if(fs.length === 0){
      fs.push({ arr: arr.slice(), cmp:[0,0], swapped:false, settledUpTo:0, round:0, j:0, cmpCount:0, swapCount:0, finished:true });
    } else {
      fs[fs.length-1].finished = true;
    }
    return {frames: fs, finalArr: arr, early};
  }

  function render(){
    const n = initial.length;
    const arr = (cursor < 0) ? initial.slice() : frames[cursor].arr;
    let cmp = null, swapped = false, settledUpTo = n;
    if(cursor >= 0 && cursor < frames.length){
      cmp = frames[cursor].cmp;
      swapped = frames[cursor].swapped;
      settledUpTo = frames[cursor].settledUpTo;
    } else if(cursor < 0){
      settledUpTo = n;
    }
    if(cursor >= 0 && frames[cursor] && frames[cursor].finished){
      settledUpTo = 0;
    }

    const maxV = Math.max.apply(null, arr.concat([1]));
    const minV = Math.min.apply(null, arr.concat([0]));
    const span = Math.max(maxV - minV, 1);

    barsEl.innerHTML = "";
    for(let idx = 0; idx < arr.length; idx++){
      const wrap = document.createElement("div");
      wrap.className = "bar";
      if(cmp && (idx === cmp[0] || idx === cmp[1])){
        wrap.classList.add(swapped ? "swap" : "cmp");
      }
      if(idx >= settledUpTo){
        wrap.classList.add("done");
      }
      const body = document.createElement("div");
      body.className = "body";
      const h = 18 + 200 * ((arr[idx] - minV) / span);
      body.style.height = h + "px";
      const sp = document.createElement("span");
      sp.textContent = arr[idx];
      body.appendChild(sp);
      const lb = document.createElement("div");
      lb.className = "label";
      lb.textContent = idx;
      wrap.appendChild(body);
      wrap.appendChild(lb);
      barsEl.appendChild(wrap);
    }

    // 状态文本
    if(cursor < 0){
      statusEl.innerHTML = "初始数组。点击 <b>下一步</b> 开始第一次比较。";
    } else {
      const f = frames[cursor];
      if(f.finished){
        statusEl.innerHTML = "排序完成！最终数组：" + f.arr.join(", ") + "。总比较 " + f.cmpCount + " 次，交换 " + f.swapCount + " 次。";
      } else if(f.swapped){
        statusEl.innerHTML = "第 " + (f.round+1) + " 轮：比较 a[" + f.cmp[0] + "]=" + (f.arr[f.cmp[0]]) +
          " 与 a[" + f.cmp[1] + "]=" + (f.arr[f.cmp[1]]) + "（交换前左边更大）→ <b>交换</b>。";
      } else {
        statusEl.innerHTML = "第 " + (f.round+1) + " 轮：比较 a[" + f.cmp[0] + "]=" + (f.arr[f.cmp[0]]) +
          " 与 a[" + f.cmp[1] + "]=" + (f.arr[f.cmp[1]]) + " → 顺序正确，<b>不交换</b>。";
      }
    }

    const total = frames.length;
    stepNoEl.textContent = (cursor < 0 ? 0 : cursor + 1) + " / " + total;
    const f = (cursor >= 0 && frames[cursor]) ? frames[cursor] : null;
    cmpEl.textContent = f ? f.cmpCount : 0;
    swapEl.textContent = f ? f.swapCount : 0;
    nEl.textContent = n;

    btnPrev.disabled = (cursor < 0);
    btnNext.disabled = (cursor >= frames.length - 1);
    if(cursor >= frames.length - 1){ stopPlay(); }
  }

  function stopPlay(){
    playing = false;
    if(timer){ clearTimeout(timer); timer = null; }
    btnPlay.textContent = "▶ 自动播放";
  }

  function schedulePlay(){
    if(!playing) return;
    const speed = Number(speedEl.value);
    const delay = 700 / speed;
    timer = setTimeout(function(){
      if(!playing) return;
      if(cursor < frames.length - 1){
        cursor++;
        render();
        schedulePlay();
      } else {
        stopPlay();
      }
    }, delay);
  }

  function loadFromInput(){
    const parsed = parseInput(dataEl.value);
    if(!parsed){
      msgEl.textContent = "请输入 2–12 个整数（−99…999），用逗号或空格分隔。";
      return false;
    }
    msgEl.textContent = "";
    initial = parsed;
    const res = buildFrames(initial);
    frames = res.frames;
    cursor = -1;
    stopPlay();
    render();
    return true;
  }

  function save(){
    try {
      genui.setState({
        data: dataEl.value,
        speed: Number(speedEl.value)
      });
    } catch(e){}
  }

  function restore(){
    let s = {};
    try { s = genui.getState() || {}; } catch(e){ s = {}; }
    dataEl.value = (typeof s.data === "string" && s.data) ? s.data : "5,2,9,1,6,3";
    speedEl.value = (typeof s.speed === "number") ? s.speed : 1;
    speedOut.textContent = Number(speedEl.value).toFixed(2).replace(/0+$/,"").replace(/\.$/,"") + "×";
  }

  // 事件绑定
  btnNext.addEventListener("click", function(){
    if(cursor < frames.length - 1){
      cursor++;
      render();
    }
  });

  btnPrev.addEventListener("click", function(){
    if(cursor > -1){
      cursor--;
      render();
    }
  });

  btnPlay.addEventListener("click", function(){
    if(playing){
      stopPlay();
    } else {
      if(cursor >= frames.length - 1){
        // 已结束，从头播放
        cursor = -1;
        render();
      }
      playing = true;
      btnPlay.textContent = "⏸ 暂停";
      schedulePlay();
    }
  });

  btnReset.addEventListener("click", function(){
    stopPlay();
    const ok = loadFromInput();
    if(ok) save();
  });

  speedEl.addEventListener("input", function(){
    speedOut.textContent = Number(speedEl.value).toFixed(2).replace(/0+$/,"").replace(/\.$/,"") + "×";
    save();
  });

  dataEl.addEventListener("change", function(){
    stopPlay();
    const ok = loadFromInput();
    if(ok) save();
  });

  // 初始化
  restore();
  loadFromInput();
  save();

  // 首次进入若已保存有效数组，也保存速度
  save();
})();
</script>
</body>
</html>

怎么读这个实验

下一步 / 上一步：每次前进一帧，代表一次“比较相邻两元素”。橙色表示正在比较，红色表示这一帧发生了交换，绿色表示该元素已在最终位置。

自动播放：按设定速度连续单步；可在任意时刻暂停后继续单步。

比较 / 交换计数：帮助你看清冒泡排序的代价——每轮比较次数递减，交换次数取决于逆序程度。

已就位区：每一轮结束，末尾会多出一个绿色元素，因为本轮最大值被推到了最右边；若某一轮没有发生交换，排序会提前结束。

自定义数组：输入 2–12 个整数即可重新生成整个步骤序列。

假设说明

目标为升序排列，元素是整数，长度 2–12，取值范围 −99…999。

采用标准冒泡排序：外层 i 从 0 到 n−2，内层 j 从 0 到 n−2−i，比较 a[j] 与 a[j+1]，若前者大于后者则交换。

每一步“比较”记作一帧，因此总帧数等于总比较次数；交换与否则在该帧内标注。

加入“本轮无交换则提前结束”的优化，因此某些输入的帧数会少于最坏情况。

演示不改变原数组的语义，只在内存中记录每一帧的快照用于回退；保存的状态只有输入数组文本和播放速度，不保存动画帧或当前游标。
